## Common Mistakes এবং Solutions

### ❌ Mistake 1: PARTITION BY ছাড়া Window Function
```sql
-- WRONG
SELECT company, SUM(total_laid_off) OVER (ORDER BY company)
FROM layoffs_staging2;
-- আউটপুট: প্রতিটি row duplicate window calculation

-- CORRECT
SELECT company, SUM(total_laid_off) OVER (PARTITION BY company ORDER BY company)
FROM layoffs_staging2;
```

### ❌ Mistake 2: Non-aggregated columns GROUP BY ছাড়া
```sql
-- WRONG
SELECT company, country, SUM(total_laid_off)
FROM layoffs_staging2
GROUP BY company;
-- Error! country grouped নয়

-- CORRECT
SELECT company, country, SUM(total_laid_off)
FROM layoffs_staging2
GROUP BY company, country;
```

### ❌ Mistake 3: ORDER BY সংখ্যা
```sql
-- কাজ করে কিন্তু fragile
SELECT company, SUM(total_laid_off)
FROM layoffs_staging2
GROUP BY company
ORDER BY 2 DESC;

-- আরো ভালো
SELECT company, SUM(total_laid_off) AS total
FROM layoffs_staging2
GROUP BY company
ORDER BY total DESC;
```

