## Performance Tips

### 1. বড় datasets এর জন্য INDEX ব্যবহার করো
```sql
CREATE INDEX idx_company ON layoffs_staging2(company);
CREATE INDEX idx_date ON layoffs_staging2(DATE);
CREATE INDEX idx_country ON layoffs_staging2(country);
```

### 2. EXPLAIN query optimizer এর জন্য
```sql
EXPLAIN SELECT company, SUM(total_laid_off)
FROM layoffs_staging2
GROUP BY company;
-- Query কেমন execute হচ্ছে দেখায়
```

### 3. WHERE clause GROUP BY আগে use করো
```sql
-- GOOD: Filter করা data group করা
SELECT company, SUM(total_laid_off)
FROM layoffs_staging2
WHERE YEAR(date) = 2023
GROUP BY company;

-- BAD: সব data group করে পরে filter
SELECT company, SUM(total_laid_off) AS total
FROM layoffs_staging2
GROUP BY company
HAVING SUM(total_laid_off) > 10000;
-- (HAVING কাজ করে কিন্তু less efficient)
```

